  "content": "The Hon'ble Vice-President of India launches Gnani Artha - India's sovereign AI stack.\n\nWe are on a mission to expand human potential\n\nWe are always looking for curious and creative people to join us!\n\nSee Open Positions\n\nMake it Customer-Driven\n\nOur customers are our partners. We solve real problems that matter. Whether it's an admin, an end user, or an enterprise-we’re here to wow them and drive their success.\n\nWe act with urgency and accountability. We’re gritty, dependable, and focused on high-impact work-today and for the long run.\n\nWe challenge the status quo, seek feedback, and take ownership. Constant improvement is part of who we are-product, company, and self.\n\nMake it Together\n\nWe win as one team. We lead with trust, respect, and openness. We value diverse perspectives and lift each other up through every high and low.\n\nPerks and Benefits\n\n<svg width=\"48\" height=\"48\" viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n\n<path d=\"M46.5 39H45V24C45 23.2044 44.6839 22.4413 44.1213 21.8787C43.5587 21.3161 42.7957 21 42 21H31.5V9C31.5 8.20435 31.1839 7.44129 30.6213 6.87868C30.0587 6.31607 29.2956 6 28.5 6H10.5C9.70435 6 8.94129 6.31607 8.37868 6.87868C7.81607 7.44129 7.5 8.20435 7.5 9V39H6C5.60218 39 5.22064 39.158 4.93934 39.4393C4.65804 39.7206 4.5 40.1022 4.5 40.5C4.5 40.8978 4.65804 41.2794 4.93934 41.5607C5.22064 41.842 5.60218 42 6 42H46.5C46.8978 42 47.2794 41.842 47.5607 41.5607C47.842 41.2794 48 40.8978 48 40.5C48 40.1022 47.842 39.7206 47.5607 39.4393C47.2794 39.158 46.8978 39 46.5 39ZM24 39H15V30H24V39ZM24 19.5H21V22.5C21 22.8978 20.842 23.2794 20.5607 23.5607C20.2794 23.842 19.8978 24 19.5 24C19.1022 24 18.7206 23.842 18.4393 23.5607C18.158 23.2794 18 22.8978 18 22.5V19.5H15C14.6022 19.5 14.2206 19.342 13.9393 19.0607C13.658 18.7794 13.5 18.3978 13.5 18C13.5 17.6022 13.658 17.2206 13.9393 16.9393C14.2206 16.658 14.6022 16.5 15 16.5H18V13.5C18 13.1022 18.158 12.7206 18.4393 12.4393C18.